  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#5074\", \"PowerToys#33300\", \"PowerToys#47607\"], \"answer\": \"This feature request has been filed before. PowerToys#5074 is the main thread for a text replacement or expander utility. Later requests, such as #47607, were closed as duplicates of it. The archive shows no released Text Expander utility. A maintainer's comment on #5074 says it would be hard to build, because PowerToys would have to watch typing across every app and then delete and replace the typed text. Please add your 👍 and your use cases (variables, app-specific snippets, import/export) to #5074 instead of opening a new issue. Until a native utility exists, people in those tickets use third-party tools: AutoHotkey hotstrings (for example `::ftw::Free the whales`), Espanso, Beeftext, FastKeys or aText.\"}",
